          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• The formula for the length of a quarter circle may also be written as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\pi r \\times \\frac { 9 0 ^ { \\circ } } { 3 6 0 ^ { \\circ } }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.178,
            0.886,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "From these, we can guess the formula for the length of an arc of a circle in terms of the angle it makes (i.e., the angle it ‘subtends’) at the centre of the circle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.265,
            0.387,
            0.402
          ],
          "content": [
